In Classic WoW, the Voidwalker's **Consume Shadows** ability regenerates its health while out of combat, making it essentially self-sustaining — no need to re-summon or feed it between pulls. Meanwhile, the Succubus has no such sustain, so she constantly loses health and needs healing or re-summoning, making her feel like a hassle despite her higher damage.

