**Concise answer:** The Succubus's **Seduction** makes her the go-to pet for dungeons and PvP, so while questing warlocks run Voidwalkers (tanking, self-healing), the Succubi are "hidden" inside instances and battlegrounds — more common than world appearances suggest. [end of text]


